        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Akira Yoshizawa, Hirohito, Lee Bong-chang, Kenneth B. Pyle\n- Concepts: Wet-folding, Order of the Rising Sun, 5th class, Japanese history eras\n\nFacts:\n- Akira Yoshizawa developed the origami technique Wet-folding.\n- Akira Yoshizawa was given the Order of the Rising Sun, 5th class, award.\n- Lee Bong-chang tried to assassinate Hirohito.\n- The man who gave Akira Yoshizawa the Order of the Rising Sun, 5th class, award was Hirohito.\n- Kenneth B. Pyle is referenced as defining an era in Japanese history in which the assassination attempt on Hirohito is placed.",
